      "data": {
        "title": "Visible Strands, Shared Labels, Addressed Relationships",
        "description": "Route atomic edges through pair-keyed collectors and a shared corridor while retaining parallel strokes whenever readable. Render shared-surface summaries through the edge-label grammar. Give each logical edge an optional relationshipRef that opens a graph containing evidence, references, confidence, history, and discussion.",
        "differentiator": "The workspace projection, normal graph edge, bundle label, and relationship inspector all resolve to the same logical edge identities without forcing every edge to become a graph.",
